                <pb facs="1283" n="1167" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1167"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 419.11D29/79.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Price.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 10, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 5. Unless you perceive serious objection, comply instruction 104 so
                    amended as to apply final action all courts concerned in inquiry.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
